---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Sigorhaus Magazine | Geoje & the southern coast">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>English notes from a quieter Korea</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Sigorhaus Magazine is a small English travel magazine for visitors arriving through Busan
      and looking for places with a real story. We start in Geoje.
    </p>
  </section>

  <a class="card" href="/posts/maemiseong/">
    <p class="meta">Geoje · 1–2 days · Draft</p>
    <h2>Maemiseong: the castle a shipyard engineer built by hand</h2>
    <p>
      After Typhoon Maemi destroyed a seaside field, one man kept stacking stones for more than
      twenty years. Today the free open-air walls look out toward Geoga Bridge.
    </p>
  </a>
</BaseLayout>
